{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36265","headline":"送永嘉王令之任二首 一 · 方干","name":"送永嘉王令之任二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"定拟孜孜化海边，须判素髪侮流年。\n波涛不应双溪水，分野长如二月天。\n浮客若容开荻地，钓翁应免税苔田。\n前贤未必全堪学，莫读当时归去篇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36265.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36265","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}